@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### List supported platforms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/platforms

### TikTok
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/download/tiktok?url=https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/1234567890

### All-in-one (auto-detects platform)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/download/aio?url=https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/1234567890

### Instagram
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/download/instagram?url=https://www.instagram.com/reel/xxxxxxxxxxx/

### YouTube
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/download/youtube?url=https://youtu.be/xxxxxxxxxxx

### YouTube search (query-based platform)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/download/youtube-search?query=Somewhere Only We Know

### Spotify
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/download/spotify?url=https://open.spotify.com/track/xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

### Unsupported platform (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/download/not-a-real-platform?url=https://example.com

### Missing query param (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/download/tiktok

### Pinterest search with a limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/download/pinterest?url=cats&limit=3

### Deep health check (probes the upstream provider; 503 if it is failing)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health?deep=1

### Stream a media file as a download (replace with a real direct media URL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fetch-media?url=https://example.com/video.mp4&filename=clip

### Private address is refused (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fetch-media?url=http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data
